  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Needle Sword. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage.\n\nEnchanting Bow. Ranged Attack Roll: +6, range 40/160 ft. Hit: 1 Piercing damage, and the target has the Charmed condition until the start of the sprite's next turn.\n\nHeart Sight. Charisma Saving Throw: DC 10, one creature within 5 feet the sprite can see (Celestials, Fiends, and Undead automatically fail the save). Failure: The sprite knows the target's emotions and alignment.\n\nInvisibility. The sprite casts Invisibility on itself, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.230",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 25223,
